skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> Booked : student books an available slot\n(an employee is assigned)

Booked --> Cancelled : student, assigned employee or admin cancels\n[before the slot starts]
Booked --> Completed : assigned employee marks\nthe meeting as concluded\n[once the slot has started]

Cancelled --> [*]
Completed --> [*]

@enduml
